        "predicate": "summary",
        "object": "<p>Whereabouts of artist imprisoned after 2021 protests had been unknown following end of his prison term in July</p><p>Luis Manuel Otero Alcántara, a prominent Cuban dissident artist whose whereabouts remained unknown after his prison sentence ended last week, has been given permission to travel to the US, according to his official Facebook page.</p><p>Otero Alcántara, designated a prisoner of conscience by Amnesty International, was sentenced to five years in prison in 2022 for insulting national symbols, contempt and disturbing the public order.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/jul/17/cuban-dissident-artist-luis-manuel-otero-alcantara-cleared-to-travel-to-us\">Continue reading...</a>"
